			CommandBindings.Add(new CommandBinding(CloseDialogCommand, CloseDialogHandler, CloseDialogCanExecute));
			CommandBindings.Add(new CommandBinding(OpenDialogCommand, OpenDialogHandler));
		}

		private static void IsOpenPropertyChangedCallback(DependencyObject dependencyObject, DependencyPropertyChangedEventArgs dependencyPropertyChangedEventArgs)
		{
			DialogHost dialogHost = (DialogHost)dependencyObject;
			if (dialogHost._popupContentControl != null)
			{
				ValidationAssist.SetSuppress(dialogHost._popupContentControl, !dialogHost.IsOpen);
			}
			VisualStateManager.GoToState(dialogHost, dialogHost.GetStateName(), !TransitionAssist.GetDisableTransitions(dialogHost));
			if (dialogHost.IsOpen)
			{
				dialogHost._currentSnackbarMessageQueueUnPauseAction = dialogHost.SnackbarMessageQueue?.Pause();
				dialogHost.CurrentSession = new DialogSession(dialogHost);
				Window window = Window.GetWindow(dialogHost);
				if (!dialogHost.IsRestoreFocusDisabled)
				{
					dialogHost._restoreFocusDialogClose = ((window != null) ? FocusManager.GetFocusedElement(window) : null);
					if (dialogHost._restoreFocusDialogClose is DependencyObject element)
					{
						IInputElement restoreFocusElement = GetRestoreFocusElement(element);
						if (restoreFocusElement != null)
						{
							dialogHost._restoreFocusDialogClose = restoreFocusElement;
						}
					}
				}
				DialogOpenedEventArgs eventArgs = new DialogOpenedEventArgs(dialogHost.CurrentSession, DialogOpenedEvent);
				dialogHost.OnDialogOpened(eventArgs);
				dialogHost._attachedDialogOpenedEventHandler?.Invoke(dialogHost, eventArgs);
				dialogHost.DialogOpenedCallback?.Invoke(dialogHost, eventArgs);
				dialogHost._asyncShowOpenedEventHandler?.Invoke(dialogHost, eventArgs);
				Task.Delay(300).ContinueWith((Task t) => dialogHost.Dispatcher.BeginInvoke(DispatcherPriority.Background, (Action)(() =>
				{
					CommandManager.InvalidateRequerySuggested();
					dialogHost.FocusPopup()?.InvalidateVisual();
				})));
				return;
			}
			dialogHost._attachedDialogClosingEventHandler = null;
			if (dialogHost._currentSnackbarMessageQueueUnPauseAction != null)
			{
				dialogHost._currentSnackbarMessageQueueUnPauseAction();
				dialogHost._currentSnackbarMessageQueueUnPauseAction = null;
			}
			object result = null;
			DialogSession currentSession = dialogHost.CurrentSession;
			if (currentSession != null)
			{
				DialogClosedEventArgs eventArgs2 = new DialogClosedEventArgs(dialogHost.CurrentSession, DialogClosedEvent);
				dialogHost.OnDialogClosed(eventArgs2);
				dialogHost._attachedDialogClosedEventHandler?.Invoke(dialogHost, eventArgs2);
				dialogHost.DialogClosedCallback?.Invoke(dialogHost, eventArgs2);
				dialogHost._asyncShowClosedEventHandler?.Invoke(dialogHost, eventArgs2);
				dialogHost._attachedDialogClosedEventHandler = null;
				if (!currentSession.IsEnded)
				{
					currentSession.Close(currentSession.CloseParameter);
				}
				if (!currentSession.IsEnded)
				{
					throw new InvalidOperationException("Cannot cancel dialog closing after IsOpen property has been set to " + bool.FalseString);
				}
				result = currentSession.CloseParameter;
				dialogHost.CurrentSession = null;
			}
			dialogHost._dialogTaskCompletionSource?.TrySetResult(result);
			dialogHost.Dispatcher.InvokeAsync(() => dialogHost._restoreFocusDialogClose?.Focus(), DispatcherPriority.Input);
		}

		private static void SnackbarMessageQueuePropertyChangedCallback(DependencyObject dependencyObject, DependencyPropertyChangedEventArgs dependencyPropertyChangedEventArgs)
		{
			DialogHost dialogHost = (DialogHost)dependencyObject;
			if (dialogHost._currentSnackbarMessageQueueUnPauseAction != null)
			{
				dialogHost._currentSnackbarMessageQueueUnPauseAction();
				dialogHost._currentSnackbarMessageQueueUnPauseAction = null;
			}
			if (dialogHost.IsOpen)
			{
				dialogHost._currentSnackbarMessageQueueUnPauseAction = (dependencyPropertyChangedEventArgs.NewValue as SnackbarMessageQueue)?.Pause();
			}
		}

